<TITLE>Outline of In-vehicle Multiplex Communication System</TITLE>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT>As in-vehicle multiplex communication systems intended to simplify the vehicle wire harness and speed up communication, 3 types have been adopted: CAN (Controller Area Network) communication enabling high-speed communication, LIN (Local Interconnect Network) communication enabling low-cost multiplex communication, and AVC-LAN (Audio Visual Communication-Local Area Network) communication for the audio system.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
